# Generated Graphify working state. Deny by default: the post-commit hook launches
# a detached rebuild that drops transient files here (.pending_changes, .rebuild.lock,
# needs_update, .graph.tmp.json, ...) at unpredictable times, and a production release
# aborts on any untracked working-tree entry. Only the four published artifacts below
# are tracked; add another negation here if a new Graphify output should be committed.
/graphify-out/*
!/graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
!/graphify-out/.graphify_root
!/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!/graphify-out/graph.json

# Temporary local workspaces and files
tmp/
benchmarks/work/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

# Release signing secrets and encrypted recovery copies
*.encrypted.pk8
update-manifest-p256-private.dpapi
update-manifest-p256-private.pem

